I too was frustrated then surprised that the font height gets included even when text is "".
I'd've expected that to be conditional.

[Excerpt](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a743bcef4dfaf97c128a245121709f5f23de7a25/scene/gui/button.cpp#L64-L69): button.cpp, get_minimum_size()
````
	Ref<Font> font = get_theme_font(SNAME("font"));
	float font_height = font->get_height(get_theme_font_size(SNAME("font_size")));

	minsize.height = MAX(font_height, minsize.height);

	return get_theme_stylebox(SNAME("normal"))->get_minimum_size() + minsize;
````

.
